      "title": "Create a task",
    },
    "description": "Create a new task, for example a card for a bug you found, one part of a request you split, or follow-up work. It starts unassigned in the first stage, where humans prioritise it; it does not start any work. Give it a self-contained description. If it came from another task, note the new key there with update_task. kind "theme" creates a theme instead: a card that groups other cards (an epic), open or closed, in no stage, with no assignee and no work.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
