      "title": "Dismiss a system signal",
    },
    "description": "Only the selected PM in its internal general conversation; needs no owner request. Close a ready_waiting, refinement_stalled, structural_pattern or milestone_closed system signal of your wake-up that needs nothing. Structural signals are for you only: never put them in signal_ids; close every one you do not propose a review on. Every card a ready_waiting signal names must wait on purpose; a refinement_stalled signal must be intermediate or resolved. It is a plain closing, not a human decision. Give the reason in note. A ready_waiting signal does not come back until another card becomes ready. A signal you already presented is the owners' to decide (operator_signal_closed).",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
