    "description": "Get a task: title, description, stage, status, assignee, labels, links (pull requests, branches), its relations to other cards, its theme (a theme shows its cards and progress), its parent, subtasks, attachments (open one with read_attachment) and recent timeline. The description is shown whole up to 20000 characters; a longer one is shown in parts, and the result says how to read the rest. A long timeline note, question or answer is cut; with event_id (named on the cut line) the call returns that one text whole instead of the task.",
    "inputSchema": {
