    "description": "Only the selected project manager in its internal general conversation; never in guest conversations. Needs no open owner request. The questions an owner answered on cards since you last looked, which they have not given a verdict on yet, the earliest answer first. Offer them to the owner in your answer to their message; the call counts as a look, so the same answers come back only if you did not mark them. Refused with docs_not_configured when the project has no decision log. more true: there are further candidates, call again after marking these.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#",
      "additionalProperties": false,
